{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","content_id":"7eba30c9-dff6-4187-8bf8-39749a564fc3","description":"‘Dear Accounting Officer’ letters provide advice on accountability, regularity, propriety, value for money and annual accounting exercises.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"digital.communications@hmtreasury.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a6870857935cf9309ea689d","filename":"DAO0726_injunctions_and_information_sharing.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":273638,"filename":"DAO0726_injunctions_and_information_sharing.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9418552","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"DAO 07/26 Sharing information covered by injunctions","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6870857935cf9309ea689d/DAO0726_injunctions_and_information_sharing.pdf"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9418578","isbn":"","title":"DAO 07/26 Sharing information covered by injunctions","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This DAO provides supplementary guidance on the procedures that should be followed in respect of informing the Public Accounts Committee (PAC) and the Comptroller and Auditor General (C&amp;AG) as part of the process for determining whether to seek or renew a super-injunction. Both the PAC and the C&amp;AG expect the C&amp;AG to be informed of any matter with potential material financial consequences so that they may determine the significance of such information for their statutory audit responsibilities.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:10:27Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1994e0e4-bd19-4966-bbd7-f293d6e90a6b"],"featured_attachments":["9418552","9418578"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-28T12:10:27.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-28T12:10:27+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","base_path":"/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","content_id":"7eba30c9-dff6-4187-8bf8-39749a564fc3","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-28T11:10:27Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"DAO 07/26 Sharing information covered by injunctions","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","base_path":"/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","content_id":"59903217-082e-4a3c-ba8b-b1fb32998185","document_type":"html_publication","links":{"parent":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/dao-0726-sharing-information-covered-by-injunctions","base_path":"/government/publ